  "description": "From childhood, Heinrich was raised by his father, the emperor, as nothing more than an instrument of the imperial household, subjected to abuse. Such treatment caused Heinrich to become obsessed with Theo, who had shown him even the slightest bit of attention. As an adult, Heinrich succeeded in seizing the emperor's power and commanded Theo to submit beneath his feet... \n\n *“I am delighted that Theo is now in my grasp.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
